Modifications for API Share:

- Package renamed from httpx to bunhttp.
- BunOptions accepts a per-request ProxyFunc (for HTTP(S)_PROXY / NO_PROXY)
  and a uTLS configuration carrying the relay client's certificate policy.
  The idle pool key includes the selected proxy.
- OpenCode version constants are exported for the gateway's header shaping.
- bunRequestHead is exposed as RequestHead for tests and diagnostics.
- Content-Length is computed once in Bun's common-header block, including
  for empty bodies. The v2 client version follows OpenCode 2.1.1.
- Proxy/TLS policy wiring, request headers and response decompression remain
  unchanged from upstream.

The free-request shaping in cmd/apishare/opencode_free.go and
opencode_encoding.go also adapts the v2 Chat body ordering, completion limit,
tool strict defaults and platform descriptions from upstream commits
f9ef5693ab58d4c2c03f63329399732f8b0e9007 and
5c5100c47076f675712b50d36fd5aa27833d3216 (2026-10-23).
The free-exit abuse classification and cooldown in opencode_free_retry.go
and opencode_limits.go adapt upstream internal/gateway/abuse.go and the
exit handling in commit 0bb23c7a7f0b7cbe08c475e7148c56bc477abcf9
(2026-10-21), scoped to API Share's per-channel proxy selection.

This package is distinct from cmd/apishare/third_party/opencode, which
contains MIT-licensed OpenCode tool definitions.
